      "type": "text",
      "value": "Consider the following problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Minimize $f ( x , y ) = ( x - 1 ) ^ { 2 } + ( y - 3 ) ^ { 2 }$"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(14)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Subject to $x + y \\leq 2 , y \\geq x$"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Use the following formula for the minimization problem and find the minimum values for x and y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Lagrangian, $\\begin{array} { r } { L = f ( x ) + \\sum _ { i = 1 } ^ { p } \\lambda _ { i } \\cdot h _ { i } ( x ) . } \\end{array}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "KKT constraints are as follows: $\\begin{array} { r } { \\frac { \\partial L } { \\partial x _ { i } } = 0 , i = 1 , 2 , \\cdots , d . } \\end{array}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\lambda _ { i } \\geq 0 , i = 1 , 2 , \\cdots , p .\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nh _ { i } ( x ) \\leq 0 , i = 1 , 2 , \\cdots , p .\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
